'''Fire Bat''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] pet that can be obtained from the [[Common Egg]] through hatching it, or through trading. 

== Appearance ==
The Fire Bat has the same design as [[Bat]], but its whole body is bright red with a fire trail following it from behind.
== Trivia ==
*This item is the non-chroma version of the [[Chroma Fire Bat]], and the fire version of the normal [[Bat]].

